    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first-person speedrunning challenge, every movement counts. Nail your jumps, optimize your path, and keep that momentum flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708070/extras/a13edc3b18d2e60b4328ca4111bf358a.poster.avif?t=1742501964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708070/extras/a13edc3b18d2e60b4328ca4111bf358a.webm?t=1742501964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gainers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect jumps don\u2019t just keep you moving \u2014 they <i>boost</i> your speed. Chain them together, and you'll turn into a momentum-fueled blur. Stopping? That\u2019s for quitters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vertical Gainer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect jumps also add verticality, opening up unexpected shortcuts and sneaky routes to maximize your gains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vibrant Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From molten volcanoes to frozen peaks, relive the chaotic charm of <i>Speedrun Acad\u00e9mie</i> with its iconic fire-and-ice level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the leaderboard and prove you\u2019re the fastest. Only the best will claim their spot among the speedrunning champions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first-person speedrunning challenge, every movement counts. Nail your jumps, optimize your path, and keep that momentum flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708070/extras/a13edc3b18d2e60b4328ca4111bf358a.poster.avif?t=1742501964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708070/extras/a13edc3b18d2e60b4328ca4111bf358a.webm?t=1742501964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gainers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect jumps don\u2019t just keep you moving \u2014 they <i>boost</i> your speed. Chain them together, and you'll turn into a momentum-fueled blur. Stopping? That\u2019s for quitters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vertical Gainer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect jumps also add verticality, opening up unexpected shortcuts and sneaky routes to maximize your gains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vibrant Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From molten volcanoes to frozen peaks, relive the chaotic charm of <i>Speedrun Acad\u00e9mie</i> with its iconic fire-and-ice level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the leaderboard and prove you\u2019re the fastest. Only the best will claim their spot among the speedrunning champions.</p>",
    "short_description": "Take on a new challenge from the Speedrun Academy. This ultra-fast first-person game pushes you to chain fluid movements, keep your momentum, and cross the finish line.",
